        "uuid": "f8113613_da1fabbf",
        "filename": "services/core/java/com/android/server/net/NetworkStatsService.java",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 1505,
      "author": {
        "id": 1306837
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-12-17T07:08:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "1. The reason we need interface is answered here:\nhttps://android-review.googlesource.com/c/platform/frameworks/base/+/1168608/6/core/java/android/net/INetworkStatsProvider.aidl#29\n\n2. The point you missed is that we\u0027ll have global alert fired frequently.\nThe limit will be re-calculated every time provider fires that, See aosp/1183413\n\n3. As for limit, yes you are right.\nWe need to devide it to prevent overshooting.\nBut we also want to prevent network from blocking if the limit is not actually reached.\nNeed more time to think about that and will reply later.",
